{"id":"isca","lemma":"isca","pos":"noun","rank":4716,"glosses":["bait (substance used in catching fish or other animals)","lure; bait (something that tempts or attracts, especially one with a promise of reward or pleasure)","a dish made with very thin slices of liver"],"ipa":"/ˈiʃ.kɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"iscas"},"examples":[{"text":"Não morda a isca.","en":"Don't take the bait.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/851962","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to bite, nip","l":"morder"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Que tipo de isca é que usas?","en":"What kind of bait do you use?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"kind"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to use","l":"usar"}]},{"text":"Tom mordeu a isca.","en":"Tom took the bait.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to bite, nip","l":"morder"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Eu uso minhocas como isca.","en":"I use worms as bait.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274366","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"use"},{"g":"earthworm","l":"minhoca"},{"g":"how / like"},null]},{"text":"Eu coloquei isca no anzol.","en":"I put bait on the hook.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/536114","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to place","l":"colocar"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"hook, fishhook"}]}]}